\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>2nd Wind was able to come out the same day and look at my HVAC. The tech was nice, professional and direct. He told me exactly what to expect and provided me a good quote. He made the experience very easy.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Matt Marks\" aria-label=\"Matt Marks\">Matt Marks</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Incredibly fast response time. I called on Thursday afternoon and they were installing my unit on Friday morning. The installation itself was also fast. The follow up service was incredibly helpful and reliable.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Marvita Franklin\" aria-label=\"Marvita Franklin\">Marvita Franklin</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Great service, very professional, and courteous! Also did a great job cleaning up after the install. They have serviced my HVAC units for over 12 years. I decided to keep the maintenance contract even after moving to a newer home. They are a consistent and reliable company. I appreciate the great work.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div>\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-5670 -->"
